              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्थितिः — sthitiḥ — \"a situation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यदि स्थितिः कठिना भवति, तर्हि अहं साहाय्यं करिष्यामि। yadi sthitiḥ kaṭhinā bhavati, tarhi ahaṃ sāhāyyaṃ kariṣyāmi. If the situation becomes hard, I will help."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्थितिः (sthitiḥ) comes from the root √sthā, \"to stand\"; MW gives sthiti \"staying or being in any state or condition\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
